  dialogueText: {fileID: 200324929}
  lines:
  - Are you out of your mind?! What do you think you're doing on someone else's premises?
  - I can overlook mistakes once or twice, but this is too much. You never get anything
    right!
  - Scrapping robots like you is better for our company!
  - I shouldn't have bought this model in the first place.
  - Get lost!
